:: D05_Random_Musician [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<<ImagePlaceholder "The cellist on the corner of Bell and Third" "float" "assets/characters/supporting/street-cellist.png">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>I stop. Something about it hooks me. The sound. Rich and low and physical, the kind of music you feel in your sternum before you hear it in your ears. She's got her eyes closed. Her bow arm moves in long, confident strokes. She's not performing. She's just playing, the way you breathe, because stopping is not an option.</p>

<p>I stand there for two songs. The first is sad and the second is sadder and both of them are beautiful in the way that things are beautiful when they don't know they're being watched.</p>

<p>When she opens her eyes, she sees me. Smiles.</p>

<p>"You looked like you needed that."</p>

<p>"Maybe I did."</p>

<p>"Bach does that. He wrote the sadness out so you don't have to carry it yourself." She adjusts a tuning peg. "I'm here most evenings. If you need him again."</p>

<p>I put three dollars in the case. She plays another note, single and clear, and nods.</p>

</div>

<<set $d05SeenMusician to true>>
<<run window.rbSpend(3, "tip")>>
<<run window.statChange("stress", -3)>>

