<</if>>
<<if $player.money gte 4>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a hot chocolate<span class="action-sub">River swears by it</span></span><span class="action-cost">$4</span>' "Grounded_Main">>
		<<run window.rbSpend(4, "coffee")>>
		<<run window.statChange("stress", -3)>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<div class="action-btn action-locked"><span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a hot chocolate<span class="action-sub">You&apos;re short</span></span></div>
<</if>>
<<link '<span class="action-icon">🛋️</span><span class="action-text">Sit in the corner booth<span class="action-sub">Cracked leather, a view of the room</span></span>' "Grounded_Booth">><</link>>
<<link '<span class="action-icon">👀</span><span class="action-text">People-watch<span class="action-sub">Everyone here is in the middle of something</span></span>' "Grounded_PeopleWatch">><</link>>
</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🗺️ Back to Northgate</span>' "District_Northgate">><</link>>
</div>


:: Grounded_Booth [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>The booth is the same one from earlier. Same cracked leather. Same view of the room. I pull out my phone and for a while I'm just a girl in a coffee shop on her phone and that's enough.</p>

</div>

<<run window.statChange("stress", -2)>>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>← Back to the counter</span>' "Grounded_Main">><</link>>
</div>


:: Grounded_PeopleWatch [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>A woman at the window table is editing what looks like a novel manuscript, crossing out whole paragraphs with a red pen and the savage joy of someone who loves killing their own words. Two students are arguing about Foucault. An older man reads a biography of someone I don't recognize. River stocks cups and hums something tuneless and catches my eye once and raises an eyebrow and I look away too fast.</p>

<p>This place is good. This place feels like somewhere I could be a person.</p>

</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>← Back to the counter</span>' "Grounded_Main">><</link>>
</div>

